item.description:
Join Polis: Center for Politics and the Civil Discourse Project for a faculty panel discussion following the 2026 midterm elections. Moderated by Sanford Dean JR DeShazo, the panel will feature: 
Asher Hildebrand: Professor of the Practice & E-MPA Director of Graduate Studies in the Sanford School of Public Policy;
Sunshine Hillygus: Professor of Political Science & Public Policy at Duke University;
Paul Teller: President of Teller Strategies, Former Director of Strategic Affairs for Vice President Mike Pence

Source: Duke University
